value.LENS_WARP_IN_TAA.1=Final (stretch)
value.LENS_WARP_IN_TAA.2=TAA
option.LENS_CHROMATIC=Lateral Chromatic Aberration
option.LENS_CHROMATIC.comment=Rainbow fringes toward the image edges (wavelength sampled)
option.LENS_AXIAL_CA=Axial Chromatic Aberration
option.LENS_AXIAL_CA.comment=Purple fringes on foreground bokeh, green on background bokeh (needs Depth of Field)
option.LENS_SOFT_FOCUS=Spherical Aberration Glow
option.LENS_SOFT_FOCUS.comment=Soft glowing highlights of vintage lenses wide open (needs Bloom)
option.LENS_SWIRL=Swirly Bokeh
option.LENS_SWIRL.comment=Field curvature and astigmatism make the background swirl (needs Depth of Field)
option.LENS_OPTICAL_VIGNETTING=Optical Vignetting
option.LENS_OPTICAL_VIGNETTING.comment=Corner falloff and cat's eye bokeh at the edges
option.LENS_HALATION=Halation
option.LENS_HALATION.comment=Red glow around strong lights (a film effect, needs Bloom under Post Processing > Effects)
screen.LENS=Lens
screen.LENS.comment=How the lens renders the scene. From the top: flare and ghosts, glow (bloom is under Post Processing > Effects), aberrations and edges (distortion, chromatic aberration, optical vignetting, vignette). With the Custom lens, set the details in Custom Lens at the top right
