option.EXPOSURE_ISO_AUTO_MIN_SHUTTER=Auto ISO Slow Limit
option.EXPOSURE_ISO_AUTO_MIN_SHUTTER.comment=Shutter speed at which Auto ISO starts raising the ISO. Auto: 1 / focal length (35 mm equivalent, from the field of view; about 1/14 s at FOV 80), faster with the spyglass
