option.LOCAL_TONEMAP=HDR Mode
option.LOCAL_TONEMAP.comment=Local tonemapping like a phone's HDR photo. Darkens bright areas (torch-lit walls, lava, the sky) and brightens dark areas around them, so a night scene keeps detail in both. The value is how much of the brightness difference between areas is removed; higher looks flatter. Dark areas are raised by at most 2 EV and bright areas lowered by at most 3 EV. Overall brightness stays with auto exposure. Edges between bright and dark areas are kept sharp. OFF removes it entirely. Light cost (also runs the bloom downsample when Bloom is off).
