option.GENERIC_LIGHT_TEST=Unlisted Emissive Block Test
option.GENERIC_LIGHT_TEST.comment=For testing. Treats listed emissive blocks (except lava) as unlisted blocks, so only the unlisted emissive block light makes them glow. Shown in orange in the voxel slice debug view
